Yi-Chia Chen and the proof-pilot contributors, and is distributed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).
The CUDA 12.8 / H200+B200 container, launchers and port into this repository are by the FM-Pochi authors,
under the same license.

This directory includes or patches third-party code, which keeps its own license:
- SGLang (Apache-2.0, SGLang Team) and vLLM (Apache-2.0, vLLM project): modified source files in
  docker/opd_serve/sglang_patches/, the anchored source patchers in teacher_extract/ and
  opd_v2/flash_rl/patches/, and deploy/target/olmo2_sink.py. Original copyright headers are preserved.
- FlashAttention (BSD-3-Clause, Tri Dao): olmo3_sink/fa3_attention_sink.patch is a patch against its
  hopper/ sources; olmo3_sink_fa2.py calls the stock flash-attn-2 kernels.
- Liger Kernel (BSD-2-Clause): used, not vendored (olmo3_sink/liger.py integrates it).
- Hugging Face Transformers (Apache-2.0): olmo3_sink/modeling_olmo3_sink.py subclasses its OLMo 3 classes.
- DeepSeek-V4 (MIT): train_core/encoding_dsv4.py is DeepSeek's published V4 chat encoding, vendored.
